{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 21, "ref": "ezekiel 20:21", "book": "ezekiel", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 20, "translation": "Men barnen trotsade mig: i ⟨את⟩ mina stadgar vandrade de inte, och ⟨את⟩ mina domar höll de inte för att göra ⟨את⟩ dem, vilket den människa gör och skall leva genom dem; ⟨את⟩ mina sabbater vanhelgade de, och jag sade mig utgjuta min glöd över dem, för att fullborda min vrede mot dem i öknen.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וימרו", "gloss": "men trotsade"}, {"surface": "בי", "gloss": "mot mig"}, {"surface": "הבנים", "gloss": "barnen"}, {"surface": "בחקותי", "gloss": "i mina stadgar"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "inte"}, {"surface": "הלכו", "gloss": "vandrade"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "mina domar"}, {"surface": "משפטי", "gloss": "mina domar"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "inte"}, {"surface": "שמרו", "gloss": "höll"}, {"surface": "לעשות", "gloss": "att göra"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ dem"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "vilket"}, {"surface": "יעשה", "gloss": "gör"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ dem"}, {"surface": "האדם", "gloss": "människan"}, {"surface": "וחי", "gloss": "och leva"}, {"surface": "בהם", "gloss": "genom dem"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "mina sabbater"}, {"surface": "שבתותי", "gloss": "mina sabbater"}, {"surface": "חללו", "gloss": "vanhelgade"}, {"surface": "ואמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "לשפך", "gloss": "att utgjuta"}, {"surface": "חמתי", "gloss": "min glöd"}, {"surface": "עליהם", "gloss": "över dem"}, {"surface": "לכלות", "gloss": "att fullborda"}, {"surface": "אפי", "gloss": "min vrede"}, {"surface": "בם", "gloss": "mot dem"}, {"surface": "במדבר", "gloss": "i öknen"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T19:14:40.009723739Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}